'''Lone Moon Lunos''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

